    <title>37. 高能量就是优秀吗？低能量的人就不配社交吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699db8c666e2c30377425e06</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699db8c666e2c30377425e06</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这个强调社交价值的时代，我们选择回归本质——关注人在社交中的真实状态与需求。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们相信，无论能量高低，都是个体与世界连接的独特方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>高能量不是优越，低能量并非缺陷，重要的是找到属于自己的社交节奏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，我们探讨如何卸下能量伪装，在社交中既保持自我又不失联结。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">00:01:32</a> 社交小逃兵的自白：我95%的时间都在策划「完美回避方案」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">00:03:31</a> 你的能量是「满格WiFi」还是「省电模式」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">00:06:58</a> 社交玄学：当你不把社交当任务，能量消耗直接清零！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">00:18:50</a> 宁愿「贷款」，也要维持20%的社交电量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">00:26:20</a> 朋友们一走，瞬间像泄了气的皮球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3166">00:52:46</a> 80瓦的电源没必要装成220瓦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3704">01:01:44</a> 笑容背后的能量消耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4236">01:10:36</a> 低能量「树懒式快乐」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4974">01:22:54</a> 社交新主张：允许「留白」时刻，不必总是「演技全开」！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加管理员微信：PFTT2024，备注“平凡探讨听友群”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待你的加入，与我们一起平凡探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书 </span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/67106f82000000001d031429?xsec_token=YBtbphdRmM6fBNxNr11mSNtO1rK5xhuY0QYfOUHZSO72I=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67106f82000000001d031429&amp;apptime=1735481950&amp;share_id=b6690e38973b4056af81968cfb3a7655" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/67106f82000000001d031429?xsec_token=YBtbphdRmM6fBNxNr11mSNtO1rK5xhuY0QYfOUHZSO72I=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67106f820