    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着2026年的到来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着平凡探讨的订阅突破1W！</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着我们对节目内容进行新的尝试！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期！2026年的第一期！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们隆重地邀请到了独立设计师、品牌创业者、前纽约州艺术留学生，Mike隋的终身老板：钰婷（小红书：</span></strong><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/AgFMKoDKi5D" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/AgFMKoDKi5D"><strong><span>al_yuting</span></strong></a><strong><span>）。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><em><span>本期内容：</span></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">00:04:19</a>平凡探讨背后的「操盘手」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">00:09:10</a> 结婚三年，终于在对方面前「放屁」了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">00:24:32</a> 「沟通」像练肌肉：越练习，越自如，关系也越紧密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">00:34:33</a> 平凡探讨能为「听友们」做些什么？期待大家的留言~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">00:38:15</a> 为什么有些事情不向伴侣倾诉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3616">01:00:16</a> 伴侣间的「艰难对话」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4081">01:08:01</a> 生活会奖励「主动的人」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4963">01:22:43</a> 外表越坚强，内心可能更脆弱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5411">01:30:11</a> 揭露平凡探讨的前身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5613">01:33:33</a> 平凡探讨有「人感」！听友朋友们，你们觉得呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6034">01:40:34</a> 听友们想在平凡探讨听到什么样的探讨呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7098">01:58:18</a> 参与到平凡探讨的「线下录制」，体验感如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7986">02:13:06</a> 平凡探讨的「终极愿景」</span></p><span></span><h2><em><span>听友群：</span></em></h2><span></span><p><span>添加管理员微信：PFTT2024，备注“平凡探讨听友群”。</span></p><span></span><p>