    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期的探讨继续围绕《我们内心的冲突》一书展开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲密关系中来自对方的期待是否会与我们的真实想法相违背？</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作中面对一而再，再而三的无理压榨我们是否该学会说不？</span></p><span></span><p><span>冲突是否源于他人对我们的期待与我们对他人的期待的不同？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>欢迎你来到平凡探讨，希望可以陪伴你度过、成长、进化成更好的自己。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>世界这么大，今天总算把你得容心之处摆在你眼前了，请进吧❤️</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 当他人的期待与我们不符时所带来的冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> 面对组建家庭的“最后一次”机会所面临的“困境”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 班儿人说“不”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3414">56:54</a> 别人对我们的期待vs我们对别人的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4697">78:17</a> 听友们关于“冲突”的投稿</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加管理员微信：PFTT2024，备注“平凡探讨听友群”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待你的加入，与我们一起平凡探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书 </span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/67106f82000000001d031429?xsec_token=YBtbphdRmM6fBNxNr11mSNtO1rK5xhuY0QYfOUHZSO72I=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67106f82000000001d031429&amp;apptime=1735481950&amp;share_id=b6690e38973b4056af81968cfb3a7655" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/67106f82000000001d031429?xsec_token=YBtbphdRmM6fBNxNr11mSNtO1rK5xhuY0QYfOUHZSO72I=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67106f82000000001d031429&amp;apptime=1735481950&amp;share_id=b6690e38973b4056af81968cfb3a7655"><span>平凡探讨播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>抖音 </span></strong><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iyy8voMt/%204@5.com" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iyy8voMt/%204@5.com